  },
  {
   "key": "u00832",
   "en": "I'll require your cooperation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00833",
   "en": "No idea. The commandos wouldn't let anyone near them. They seemed heavy, though.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00834",
   "en": "The rule is \"don't rock the boat.\" Self-interest is tolerated if it doesn't interfere with business. Anoleis is driving customers away.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00835",
   "en": "Do you know what she had in the crates?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00836",
   "en": "I thought corruption was the rule on Noveria.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00837",
   "en": "Corruption",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00838",
   "en": "What was in the crates?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00839",
   "en": "The Executive Board votes whether or not to destroy the facility. One antimatter warhead from the battlestations vaporizes all contaminants.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00840",
   "en": "You know where I work. Come talk to me when you change your mind.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00841",
   "en": "That's gratifying to hear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00842",
   "en": "I don't believe this. You've ruined a--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00843",
   "en": "And if the crew never sends an all-clear?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00844",
   "en": "I'm not here to dig out any corporate secrets.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00845",
   "en": "What if there's no all-clear?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00846",
   "en": "I'm not here for them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00847",
   "en": "Look, Shepard. I don't like this either. You Spectres play fast and loose with the law. That's bad for business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00848",
   "en": "While I'm young, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00849",
   "en": "Son of a bitch! This is what I get for entrusting it to a Spectre. What'd you do -- hold a gun to his head and order him to do it? God.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00850",
   "en": "Get out of here. I need to see if I can salvage anything from this. I do not want to spend another six months wearing this outfit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00851",
   "en": "Pff. You know what? Forget it. I should have known better. Spectres never care about anything beyond their mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00852",
   "en": "You underestimated Noveria's code of silence. Qui'in wouldn't rock the boat, no matter what assurance I offered.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00853",
   "en": "He wouldn't testify.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00854",
   "en": "Hurry it up already.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00855",
   "en": "I've got a lot of work to do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00856",
   "en": "Fly off and cause problems for someone else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00857",
   "en": "She is here. I can't believe it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00858",
   "en": "Commander? Maybe we should tell Liara that her mother's here. Or bring her along. Maybe she can reason with Benezia.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00859",
   "en": "Commander? Maybe we ought to tell Liara that her mom's here. Or bring her along. It might take Benezia off-guard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00860",
   "en": "Commander, it might be wise to bring Dr. T'Soni along. She knows her mother better than any of us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00861",
   "en": "If Lady Benezia is here, it might be wise to bring Liara along. She knows her mother better than we do.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00862",
   "en": "All right.  I'll talk to Qui'in and see if I can convince him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00863",
   "en": "You've never worked in the corporate world, have you, Commander? You can't bludgeon through bureaucracy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00864",
   "en": "Talk to Lorik Qui'in. You should be able to find him at the hotel bar.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00865",
   "en": "Can't say more. Not within earshot of Mr. Anoleis.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00866",
   "en": "So it would seem. I need an alternative.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00867",
   "en": "I can bludgeon pretty hard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00868",
   "en": "All right. What would you do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00869",
   "en": "I can see that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00870",
   "en": "Don't underestimate me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00871",
   "en": "What do you suggest?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00872",
   "en": "I'd like to help you, Miss Parasini, but I need Qui'in's garage pass. It's vital to my mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00873",
   "en": "I have my own mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00875",
   "en": "Get off my back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00876",
   "en": "I don't think Qui'in will agree to testify. Can't you just take the evidence?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00877",
   "en": "I doubt Qui'in will help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00878",
   "en": "Talk to you later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00880",
   "en": "I'm a little busy now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03B_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00881",
   "en": "I don't think you're supposed to be in here, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00882",
   "en": "Oh, now you're going to show some respect?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00883",
   "en": "Leave? You think I'm going to let you walk out? Uh-uh. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00884",
   "en": "I'm Sergeant Kaira Stirling, Elanus Risk Control Services.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00885",
   "en": "Anoleis would throw you offworld for what you did here. I won't. You know what we did to cop killers on my world?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00886",
   "en": "Your men are dirty, Sergeant. You're here off-duty, breaking the law for bribe money.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00887",
   "en": "You're breaking the law for bribe money. You know what we do to dirty cops on my world?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00888",
   "en": "What a load of crap. You're here off-duty, breaking the law for bribe money. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00889",
   "en": "Being a cop doesn't give you the right to break the law yourself. You accepted bribe money.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00890",
   "en": "You're here off-duty, breaking the law for bribe money. You expect us to feel bad for stopping you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00891",
   "en": "Well, I don't need a gun to rip you to pieces.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00892",
   "en": "You talk the talk. Let's see if you can walk after I break your legs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00894",
   "en": "I'll be keeping my eye on you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00895",
   "en": "You're not so tough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00896",
   "en": "You better toe the line here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00897",
   "en": "You have me at a disadvantage, Miss...?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00898",
   "en": "Do you plan on making me leave?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00899",
   "en": "No, I'm not. Are you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00900",
   "en": "I didn't want to fight them. They fired first.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00901",
   "en": "If you want a fight, I'll give you one.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00902",
   "en": "I have a mission to complete. I did what I had to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00904",
   "en": "Your point?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00906",
   "en": "They didn't give me a choice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00907",
   "en": "Bring it on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00908",
   "en": "I'm on a mission.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_03A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_ICE20_06_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u00909",
   "en": "I have a lot of paperwork to do here. If you don't mind?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_ICE20_01A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
